  repository (https://github.com/raycast/extensions), copyright Raycast
  Technologies Ltd., licensed under the MIT License. SOURCE.json records the
  exact repository, pull request or branch, commit SHA and fetch date the
  snapshot was taken from. `rx greptile drift` compares it with the live copy.

